  "solution": "I. 7 × 9 + 5 – 8 ÷ 4 = 42\n\nAfter interchanging 5 and 9, we get:\n\n__**7 × 5**__ + 9 – __**8 ÷ 4**__ = 42\n\n⇒ __**35 + 9**__ - 2 = 42\n\n⇒ __**44 - 2**__ = 42\n\n⇒ 42 = 42\n\nII. 9 × 3 + 5 ÷ 1 – 4 = 20\n\nAfter interchanging 5 and 9, we get:\n\n__**5 × 3**__ + __**9 ÷ 1**__ – 4 = 20\n\n⇒ 15 + 9 - 4 = 20\n\n⇒ __**24 - 4**__ = 20\n\n⇒ 20 = 20\n\nHence, ‘**Both I and II**’ is the correct answer.",
